                                "sense_id": "c2ccd16a-c2df-31c0-aecd-165d0af00704",
                                "text": "That summer overhanded pitching was legalized, resulting in a slew of no-hitters, including the only ones ever pitched at Recreation Park."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c5b1880-518a-4054-9c48-2632b545537a",
                                "sense_id": "c2ccd16a-c2df-31c0-aecd-165d0af00704",
                                "text": "As has been mentioned earlier, there are various ways to hold a bow, the most obvious difference being between the overhanded method and the underhanded method."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d65f83ba-44ba-4dfc-b3a0-0137bba78d61",
                                "sense_id": "c2ccd16a-c2df-31c0-aecd-165d0af00704",
                                "text": "To make an overhanded knot, you pass the end of the rope over the standing part and through the bight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30f84e77-32bd-4abc-82fa-5702277de70d",
                                "sense_id": "c2ccd16a-c2df-31c0-aecd-165d0af00704",
                                "text": "An overhanded patch is used on material that is seldom washed, and where the raw edge on the wrong side is not objectionable."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dfc66dff-c029-37ad-92eb-fd8e5c7c8537",
                        "entry_id": "315aede1-f207-3e4b-b982-bec1daf512dd",
                        "glosses": [
